  "content": "<p>Not happy with the available box generators for the laser cutter? Build your own. One of our members vibe coded a custom version and used it right away to make a proper enclosure for one of our button machines.<br />Software available here: <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/simmarith/dxfdesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">codeberg.org/simmarith/dxfdesi</span><span class=\"invisible\">gn</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/lasercutter\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>lasercutter</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/vibecoding\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>vibecoding</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/boxmaker\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>boxmaker</span></a></p>",
